<title>FINLAND: Tieto says buys two Norwegian firms.</title>
<headline>Tieto says buys two Norwegian firms.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish data services group TT Tieto Oy said on Tuesday it had acquired two Norwegian data companies, Huldt &amp; Lillevik AS and Aas Data AS, for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>&quot;The deals will strengthen the group's knowledge of personnel management (systems),&quot; Tieto said in a statement.  </p>
<p>Huldt &amp; Lillevik is Norway's leading wage accounting system supplier with 14 million markka net sales and a 4.2 million markka net profit in 1996, Tieto said.</p>
<p>Aas Data is a wage accounting support supplier with 16.9 million markka net sales and a 1.6 million markka net profit, it said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
